Version 0.2.0 is a heavy refactoring of the original code. Beware.

# Changelog

## [0.2.0] - 2025-10-04

To do: grab the highlights from the git log.

- Heavily refactored:
  - midi::bus/masterbus paradigm fixes.
  - JACK and ALSA port management changes.
- C++
  - Converted assignments (operator =) to initialization (the "{}"
    universal initializer).
  - Converted member initialization to in-class initialization.

